# =============================================================================
# GROK-ORCHESTRATOR-KIT — example environment file
# Copy to .env and replace every value marked CHANGE_ME.
# 复制为 .env，并替换所有 CHANGE_ME 标记的值。
# =============================================================================

# --- Gateway / 网关 ----------------------------------------------------------
# Bind address for the NovaApi gateway. 127.0.0.1 = local only (recommended).
# 绑定地址：127.0.0.1 仅本机；0.0.0.0 暴露到局域网。
NOVAAPI_BIND=127.0.0.1
NOVAAPI_PORT=8000
NOVAAPI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# --- Secrets / 密钥（务必修改 CHANGE_ME）--------------------------------------
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@novaapi.local
ADMIN_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_ADMIN_PASSWORD
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_DB_PASSWORD

# --- Registration engine / 注册引擎 ------------------------------------------
PROGROK_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3080
HOTMAIL_HELPER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:17373
SOLVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5072

# Optional: explicit credential output directory. Leave empty to auto-detect
# via ProGrok GET /api/output-paths.
# 可选：凭据落盘目录，留空则自动从 ProGrok /api/output-paths 获取。
GROK_ACCOUNTS_DIR=

# Optional: use NovaApi API-key auth instead of email/password.
# 可选：使用 API Key 代替账号密码登录。
NOVAAPI_API_KEY=

TZ=Asia/Shanghai
